            "text": "<p>Citrine, Green Aventurine and African Turquoise all belong to the <strong>quartz family</strong> — and quartz is so steady in frequency that it keeps time in every watch and radio. Worn together at your pulse, the three <strong>resonate as one</strong>, sending a stronger, steadier signal than any single stone.</p>"
