            "title": "Vibrational Field Clearing",
            "text": "<p>Everything vibrates at a frequency — you too. Stress, debt and scarcity pull you into a <strong>low-frequency state that pushes opportunity away</strong>. The bracelet helps <strong>clear that interference</strong> and raise you back to your natural prosperity frequency — so what you ask for can finally arrive.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image_asset": "aurea-science-ill-4.jpg",
            "title": "Not a vision board. A signal.",
            "text": "<p>What Tibetan monks knew for centuries, physics now measures. No journaling, no \"manifest harder\" — it works <strong>whether you believe or not</strong>, through real frequency. Worn at your pulse, your intention stops being a thought… and becomes a <strong>signal</strong>.</p>"
          }
        }
